@34838 = ~Actually, I don't think you'll have any more murders. A Shade Lord had possessed your ranger, Merella, and it has been destroyed.~
@34839 = ~Actually, I don't think you'll have any more murders. A Shade Lord had possessed your ranger, Merella, and it has been destroyed.~
