@37820 = ~あれは何だろう？あそこ！~
@37821 = ~Among those who speak the animal tongues, the tales of Wilson the bear's adventures are well-known and loved. A defender of the weak and a tireless crusader for peace in a world rife with violence, Wilson's courage and heroism are the stuff of legend in the animal kingdoms. The legends of Wilson passed down through the generations are countless, but a few stand out. A favorite among the deer and gazelle, among others, is the story of how he freed countless species from the tyrannical rule of corrupt Lion Kingdom. After ending his own kind's murderous rampage against fish, he was the first and only mammal ever to be made a saint to the salmon. But perhaps his greatest triumph came when he forged a lasting peace in the ages-old conflict between cats and dogs. For all these things and more, Wilson is remembered fondly by all good and steadfast members of the wild kingdom. He died peacefully during hibernation at the age of thirty-seven, surrounded by family and friends.~
@37822 = ~約束は？~
@37823 = ~<DAY>　<MONTHNAME>~
@37824 = ~<MONTHNAME>~
@37825 = ~コンティンジェンシー~
@37826 = ~コンティンジェンシー　-　ストーンスキン~
@37827 = ~とても気分が悪くなり、先ほどとった食事をもどしてしまった。意識がうつろになり、何故こうなってしまったかわけがわからない。そういえばロスアンダーがこう言っていた。「お前は毒にやられた！」と。どうやら彼の言葉に嘘はないらしい。そしてこの毒は彼にしか中和できない。~
@37828 = ~Who calls Chan, Prince of Air?!~
@37829 = ~Who calls Sunnis, Prince of Earth?!~
@37830 = ~Who calls Zaaman Rul, Prince of Fire?!~
@37831 = ~いいいいけにえ…　お前の血まみれの頭だ…~
@37832 = ~Help!~
@37833 = ~手を貸してくれ！~
@37834 = ~守ってくれ！~
@37835 = ~あいつを倒してくれ！~
@37836 = ~もう耐えられない~
@37837 = ~もう駄目だ~
@37838 = ~慈悲を！~
@37839 = ~あなたは呪文を唱えたが、しばらく何も起こらない。何かが足に当たり下を見ると、驚いたことにコルクで栓をしたガラス瓶があり、中に手紙が入っている。あなたはボトルの栓を抜き、手紙を取り出す。~
