@40942 = ~Psionic Blast
A mind flayer's preferred method of attack is the psionic blast, a blast of mental energy that will stun an opponent for five rounds unless a save vs. Spell is made.~
@40943 = "~ Portuguese (Brazilian) Translation ~

~ By Edson Belo de Oliveira Júnior ~

~ Special Thanks ~
My wife Janaína Dias Gomes dos Santos, my children, Flávia and Bernardo, and the communities of Avengers of Balduran and Baldur's Gate.com for their support. Thank you!
