@40946 = ~Icewind Dale: Adventurers of Neverwinter~
@40947 = ~Brand-new art and voice sets from Beamdog to build your character around! Customize your Icewind Dale: Enhanced Edition experience with this collection of eleven new character portraits and seven new voice sets. Mark Meer returns to deliver character voices for fan-favorites, Alveus Malcanter and Baeloth!

Features:
– 11 new portraits
– 7 new voice sets including two from Mark Meer!~
